    - {fileID: -3263074623129762138, guid: f5e3baeb6ac82454599eb01b299d517e, type: 3}
    animationFps: 1.8
    effect: 0
  - title: Vulnerability
    body: When exhausted, the boss collapses. Draw the shown characters before the
      timer runs out to damage the boss!
    frames:
    - {fileID: -2325852028376257296, guid: 4a477721e5dc6db48beb514d094a8ccc, type: 3}
    animationFps: 0
    effect: 0
  - title: Teleportation
    body: Once low on health, the boss grows desperate. It starts teleporting to
      summon minions from anywhere on the field.
    frames:
    - {fileID: 95172164111334305, guid: f6ede119ad3b6824b9652c0513057a7c, type: 3}
